# TDD cycle repair requirements

## REQ-M5-WAVE1-TDD-001: Repair one stale parallel-bound TDD cycle
Priority: must
Type: functional
Pattern: event-driven
Statement: When a confirmed repair is requested for a TDD cycle with a stale parallel plan or assignment binding, the system shall select the target by stable cycle identity and append a replacement or retirement without deleting or rewriting the original cycle.
Acceptance: public grammarは`tdd repair [test-id]`とし、normal modeでは`<test-id> --cycle <cycle-id>`、exactly one of `--replacement-cycle <cycle-id>` or `--retire`、`--approver <name> --reason <text> --confirm`を必須とすること。normal modeでtest IDがない場合はexit 2 `CLI_ERROR: <test-id> is required.`で0 writeとなり、`--resume`および`--abandon-pending` modeはpositional test IDを禁止すること。replacement modeは既に記録済みのcurrent authoritative Red/Green cycleを検証して旧cycleへ結合し、retirement modeはwrite時にexactly one independently eligible fallback cycleがcurrentになることを検証し、その`fallbackCycleId`を含むnon-credit terminal recordを旧cycleへ結合すること。retirementのadmission validityはappend時の検証結果とrecorded fallback identityで固定し、後続cycleまたはprovenance変化でrepair record自体を遡及的にinvalid化しないこと。少なくとも2つのcycleを持つfixtureで対象cycle、test ID、requirement ID、CHANGE generation、およびparallel identityを一致確認し、operation identity、prior cycle identity、replacementまたはretirement/fallback linkageを持つappend-only recordを追加すること。対象外cycleのcanonical JSONとhashは不変であり、authoritative test `TEST-M5-WAVE1-TDD-REPAIR-001`が検証すること。

## REQ-M5-WAVE1-TDD-002: Fail closed and preserve TDD ledger integrity during repair
Priority: must
Type: functional
Pattern: unwanted-behavior
Statement: If a TDD repair selector, generation, test source, parallel binding, authorization, replacement cycle, or hash chain is invalid, then the system shall persist no repair and return a diagnostic scoped to the rejected target.
Acceptance: 欠落または競合するCLI option、blank reason/approver、および未確認操作はexit 2 `CLI_ERROR`で0 writeとなること。新規repairのauthorization authorityは、`approval.domains`が空ならcurrent undomained design approvalでJSON detail `domain: null`、nonemptyならstable selectorで解決したtarget requirementを所有するconfigured domainのcurrent design approvalとすること。approvalがmissing、stale、またはconfigured ownerと異なる場合はexit 1 `TDD_REPAIR_AUTHORIZATION_INVALID`、JSON details exactly `{ requirementId, domain, status }`（`domain`はnullまたはowner name、`status`は`missing`、`stale`、`domain-mismatch`のclosed enum）で0 writeとなり、completed replay、pending resume、およびpending abandonmentはmutable approvalを再検証しないこと。cycle IDが存在しない場合はexit 1 `TDD_REPAIR_TARGET_INVALID` cause `cycle-not-found`、同一cycle IDが複数存在する場合はcause `cycle-id-ambiguous`、foreign cycleはcause `foreign-operation-scope`、parallel identityがない場合はcause `target-not-parallel-bound`、parallel bindingがstaleでない場合はcause `target-parallel-binding-not-stale`、retirement fallbackが0件または複数件の場合はそれぞれcause `retirement-fallback-missing`または`retirement-fallback-ambiguous`とすること。`TDD_REPAIR_TARGET_INVALID`のcause enumはこの7値で閉じ、JSON detailsはexactly `{ cause, testId, targetCycleId }`とし、cause precedenceは`cycle-not-found`、`cycle-id-ambiguous`、`foreign-operation-scope`、`target-not-parallel-bound`、`target-parallel-binding-not-stale`、`retirement-fallback-missing`、`retirement-fallback-ambiguous`の順とすること。test ID・requirement・CHANGE/generation・parallel binding不一致はexit 1 `TDD_REPAIR_BINDING_MISMATCH`、既にrepair/retirement済みのcycleはexit 1 `TDD_REPAIR_ALREADY_RECORDED`、currentでないreplacementはexit 1 `TDD_REPAIR_REPLACEMENT_INVALID`、改変されたcompleted hash chainはexit 1 `TDD_REPAIR_CHAIN_INVALID`で0 writeとなること。journaled repairがprojection未完了の間、`tdd red|green|refactor|migrate|void`および別の新規`repair`はexit 1 `TDD_REPAIR_PENDING`、message `pending repair <operationId> for <testId>:<targetCycleId> must be resumed or abandoned before TDD evidence can change.`、JSON details exactly `{ operationId, testId, targetCycleId }`で0 writeとなること。machine-readable recovery contractは`tdd repair --resume <operation-id> --confirm [--root <directory>] [--json]`とし、operation IDは`^tdd-repair:[a-f0-9]{64}$`、positional test IDおよびnormal/abandon optionsとの併用は禁止すること。exact resume CLI errorsは`CLI_ERROR: TDD repair resume requires --confirm.`、`CLI_ERROR: --resume must match ^tdd-repair:[a-f0-9]{64}$.`、`CLI_ERROR: --resume cannot be combined with repair target or disposition options.`とすること。initial successful normal repairは`replayed: false`、`resumed: false`、successful resumeはnormal success fieldsに`replayed: false`、`resumed: true`を返して元のjournaled resultを完成し、completed normal replayは`replayed: true`、`resumed: false`を返すこと。unknown、completed、malformed journal、pending identity mismatch、またはpartial projection mismatchの`--resume`はexit 1 `TDD_REPAIR_RESUME_INVALID`、JSON details exactly `{ operationId, cause }`（cause closed enum `not-found`、`already-completed`、`journal-invalid`、`identity-mismatch`、`partial-projection-mismatch`）で0 writeとなること。audited escape contractは`tdd repair --abandon-pending <operation-id> --approver <name> --reason <text> --confirm [--root <directory>] [--json]`とし、operation IDは同じregex、positional test ID、`--resume`、`--cycle`、`--replacement-cycle`、`--retire`との併用を禁止すること。exact CLI errorsは`CLI_ERROR: TDD repair abandonment requires --confirm.`、`CLI_ERROR: --abandon-pending must match ^tdd-repair:[a-f0-9]{64}$.`、`CLI_ERROR: --abandon-pending cannot be combined with repair target, disposition, or resume options.`、既存の`CLI_ERROR: --approver is required.`、`CLI_ERROR: --reason is required.`、blank variantsとすること。abandonmentはvalid journal envelopeがoperationId、testId、targetCycleIdを一意に固定し、resumeが`journal-invalid`、`identity-mismatch`、または`partial-projection-mismatch`を返すpending entryだけを対象とし、success `failureCause`はこの3値のclosed enumとすること。recordは元pending journal object全体のcanonical JSON SHA-256 `pendingJournalSha256`と、各既存partial fragmentの`{ kind, index, sha256 }`を持つ`partialFragments[]`を固定し、locator mappingは`order`=`.musubix/evidence/order.json.records[index]`、`repair-projection`=`.musubix/evidence/tdd.json.repairs[index]`、`repair-chain`=`.musubix/evidence/tdd.json.chain[index]`、`index`は各arrayの0-based index、`sha256`はそのJSON valueのcanonical JSON bytesのlowercase SHA-256、array orderはkind precedence `order`、`repair-projection`、`repair-chain`の後にindex昇順とすること。prospective complete ledgerをwrite前に検証してから`TddRepairAbandonmentRecord`をnormal journal、monotonic order、およびnon-credit `repairAbandonments[]` projectionへappendし、repair dispositionまたはrepair chain phaseを新規projectしないこと。quarantined journal record、order record、repair projection fragment、およびrepair-chain fragmentは各元arrayに物理的かつbyte-identicalに残り、order logとTDD chainのsequence、previousSha256、recordSha256 predecessor continuityにも引き続き参加すること。recorded locator/digestと一致する既存partial fragmentsはeffective repair projection、coverage credit、source-currency credit、およびfuture cycle selectionからだけ除外し、digest不一致、duplicate locator、または未列挙fragmentはledger-invalidとしてwritersをblockし続けること。成功後のみpending blockを解除し、abandonment自身のpartial appendは同一command/inputがmissing suffixだけを完成すること。success JSONはexactly `{ abandoned: true, replayed, operationId, testId, targetCycleId, failureCause, approver, reason, order }`、textは`REPAIR ABANDON: PASS operation=<operationId> test=<testId> cycle=<targetCycleId> cause=<failureCause>`、同一canonical approver/reason replayは同じpersisted valuesと`replayed: true`を返すこと。unknown、completed、resumable、valid envelopeを持たないjournal、または既に異なるabandonmentがある場合はexit 1 `TDD_REPAIR_ABANDON_INVALID`、message `<operationId> is not one abandonable pending TDD repair.`、JSON details exactly `{ operationId, cause }`（closed enum/precedence `not-found`、`already-completed`、`resumable`、`journal-envelope-invalid`、`already-abandoned`）で0 writeとなること。normal modeのdiagnostic precedenceはCLI validation、read-only pending detection、complete repair-ledger/hash validation、completed replay、stable selector、already-recorded disposition、authorization、operation scope、binding/source、stale-parallel eligibility、replacementまたはretirement-fallback validityの順、resume modeはCLI validation、operation-state lookup、journal identity/schema、partial projection validation、prospective complete ledger validation、append-only completionの順、abandon modeはCLI validation、operation-state lookup、valid envelope、resume failure classification、existing abandonment replay/conflict、prospective complete ledger validation、append-only abandonmentの順とし、resume/abandon completion後に新たなvalidation failureを返さないこと。CLIのdomain-failure exit-code registryは全`TDD_REPAIR_*`をexit 1として登録すること。有効repair後はresolverが意図したrequirement batchにexactly one current cycleを選択し、`TDD_REQUIREMENT_UNCOVERED`または`TDD_GREEN_MISSING`を対象cycleについて解消する一方、abandonmentとquarantined fragmentsはnon-creditでcoverage/source-currency selectionへ影響せず、無関係なfailureを隠さないこと。`tdd void`はdangling cycle、`tdd migrate`はcurrent fingerprint移行という既存責務を維持し、stale parallel bindingのreplacement/retirementを代替してはならないこと。authoritative test `TEST-M5-WAVE1-TDD-REPAIR-SAFETY-001`が3つのabandonable resume causes、normal/resume/abandon、idempotency、abandonment crash recovery、physical retentionとorder/chain predecessor continuity、quarantine locator/order/digest tamper、zero-write failure、および既存TDD writerのpending-blocking/unblocking cross-testを検証すること。
